# 本地构建瘦身:依赖在镜像内 yarn install,运行期 storage 由 volume 挂载,这些都不进构建上下文
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
storage
docs

# Ignore everything under the storage/app-dev directory
storage/app-dev

# Ignore .umi and .umi-production directories wherever they are
**/.umi
**/.umi-production

# Ignore certain directories under packages
packages/*/*/lib
packages/*/*/esm
packages/*/*/es
packages/*/*/dist
packages/*/*/node_modules

/.vscode
/.idea

*.sqlite
/uploads

# never bake secrets into images — but keep the *.example templates:
# cli-v1 的 p-test.js 在模块加载时读 .env.e2e.example，postinstall 也会用 example 生成缺省配置
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
